{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"杏林在線｜PDRN真有其效？\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APP-ONLINE-I-PDRN-261116.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】PDRN是近年熱門的護膚成分，聲稱可以促進細胞修復，回復皮膚緊緻。不同形態的PDRN，究竟是否真的有效？今集《杏林在線》請來香港城巿大學化學系教授黃駿弦跟我們講解。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:59:29.033127+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T16:14:32.154966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:53:04.596059+00:00","content_hash":"29dfa2b21a713ab740ed815d5e31f48461185b237d9b4785d1ea8561e7366e48","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}